<script setup lang="ts">import{onMounted,ref}from 'vue';import{useRoute}from 'vue-router';import{runStore,loadRun}from '../stores/runs';import{exportRun}from '../api/runs';import{publish}from '../api/releases';import{isAdmin}from '../stores/auth';import{useTask}from '../hooks/useTask';import{usePolling}from '../hooks/usePolling';import{modelName,number}from '../utils/format';import PageHeading from '../components/common/PageHeading.vue';import ErrorNotice from '../components/common/ErrorNotice.vue';import StatusBadge from '../components/common/StatusBadge.vue';import ForecastChart from '../components/ForecastChart.vue';const route=useRoute();const{error,busy,execute}=useTask();const note=ref('作为下周日配参考，节假日需求另行复核。'),published=ref(false);const refresh=()=>execute(()=>loadRun(Number(route.params.id)));onMounted(refresh);usePolling(()=>{if(['queued','running'].includes(runStore.selected?.status||''))refresh()});const release=()=>execute(async()=>{await publish(Number(route.params.id),note.value);published.value=true});const exportFile=()=>execute(()=>exportRun(Number(route.params.id)));</script><template><PageHeading index="04 / FORECAST" :title="runStore.selected?.name||'读取预测档案'" subtitle="预测用于计划讨论，结合近期业务变化复核后发布。"/><ErrorNotice :message="error" @retry="refresh"/><template v-if="runStore.selected"><div class="section-heading"><h2>{{runStore.selected.series?.name}}</h2><StatusBadge :status="runStore.selected.status"/></div><p v-if="runStore.selected.error" class="error">{{runStore.selected.error}} <RouterLink to="/experiments">调整参数并重建任务 →</RouterLink></p><p v-if="['queued','running'].includes(runStore.selected.status)" class="empty">后台正在逐日回测，本页会自动刷新。</p><template v-if="runStore.selected.status==='completed'"><div class="result-summary"><div><small>入选模型</small><h2>{{modelName(runStore.selected.result?.selected.model)}}</h2></div><div><small>回测 MAE</small><h2>{{number(runStore.selected.result?.selected.mae)}} 束</h2></div><div><small>训练 / 验证</small><h2>{{runStore.selected.result?.training_days}} / {{runStore.selected.result?.validation_days}} 天</h2></div></div><ForecastChart :points="runStore.selected.points"/><p class="method-note">{{runStore.selected.result?.interval_note}}</p><h2>模型比较 / 滚动一步预测</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>模型</th><th>α</th><th>MAE / 束</th><th>WAPE</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="m in runStore.selected.result?.comparisons" :key="m.model+String(m.alpha)"><td>{{modelName(m.model)}}</td><td>{{m.alpha??'—'}}</td><td>{{number(m.mae)}}</td><td>{{m.wape===null?'无实际需求分母':(m.wape*100).toFixed(2)+'%'}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="section-heading"><h2>未来 {{runStore.selected.horizon}} 天的日配参考</h2><button @click="exportFile">下载预测 CSV ↓</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>日期</th><th>点预测</th><th>经验下界</th><th>经验上界</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="p in runStore.selected.points" :key="p.day"><td>{{p.day}}</td><td>{{number(p.predicted)}}</td><td>{{number(p.lower)}}</td><td>{{number(p.upper)}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><form v-if="isAdmin" class="inline-form" @submit.prevent="release"><label class="grow">发布说明<input v-model="note" minlength="3" maxlength="500" required/></label><button class="primary" :disabled="busy||published">{{published?'已发布到档案':'发布日配参考 →'}}</button></form></template></template></template>
